    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d755">

                <pb facs="1001" n="901" xml:id="pg901"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">467.11/590: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Turkey</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Shaw</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-05-27T12:00:00-04:00">May 27, 1933—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5. Your 17, May 22, 3 p.m. Department could at best send only a partial list of
                    claims, as they have not all been developed and evidence is being received
                    daily. Even such a partial list could not be made available to you before July
                    1, and its preparation would necessitate suspension of urgent work of preparing
                    claims for consideration by committee.</p>
                <p>In view of the above situation and of the fact that, as the Department
                    understands, the vacation season in Ankara will begin the middle of June and but
                    little would likely be accomplished during that season looking to lump sum
                    settlement, the Department considers it preferable to concentrate its efforts on
                    the preparation of the claims and to postpone discussions of lump sum until the
                    committee, of which it is expected that you will be a member, meets in
                        August.<anchor n="8" xml:id="d755-f1"/></p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d755-f1" n="8" xml:id="d755-f1-content">
                <p>First meeting of the Claims Committee was held on August 15, 1933, at
                    Istanbul.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
